WEBVTT

00:00:59.013 --> 00:01:03.768
(Video) [To] me, Afghanistan is a country
of hope and boundless possibilities.

00:01:07.855 --> 00:01:10.691
And every single day,

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:13.027
the girls of SOLA remind me of that.

00:01:14.237 --> 00:01:17.115
Like me, they are dreaming big.

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:20.243
That was then.

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:23.621
(Applause)

00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:24.997
And this is now.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.792
And the Taliban are back.

00:01:29.043 --> 00:01:31.379
But I want you to know
I haven't stopped dreaming.